            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Open Claude Desktop › Settings › Connectors.\n2. Click the IAGO connection (for example “%@”, Desktop type).\n3. Set the tools to “Always allow”: all at once, if Claude Desktop offers it, or one by one."
